</div></div></div></div></div><div class="fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-15 fusion-flex-container has-pattern-background has-mask-background nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling" style="--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-padding-bottom:1%;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;" ><div class="fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-content-wrap" style="max-width:1248px;margin-left: calc(-4% / 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% / 2 );"><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-35 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column" style="--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-flex-grow:0;--awb-flex-shrink:0;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-flex-grow-medium:;--awb-flex-shrink-medium:;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-flex-grow-small:;--awb-flex-shrink-small:;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column"><div class="fusion-title title fusion-title-31 fusion-sep-none fusion-title-text fusion-title-size-one" style="--awb-margin-top-small:0px;--awb-margin-right-small:0px;--awb-margin-bottom-small:20px;--awb-margin-left-small:0px;"><h1 class="fusion-title-heading title-heading-left fusion-responsive-typography-calculated" style="margin:0;--fontSize:85;line-height:.7;">Frequently Asked Questions</h1></div><div class="accordian fusion-accordian" style="--awb-border-size:1px;--awb-icon-size:13px;--awb-content-font-size:16px;--awb-icon-alignment:left;--awb-hover-color:#f9f9f9;--awb-border-color:#cccccc;--awb-background-color:#ffffff;--awb-divider-color:#e0dede;--awb-divider-hover-color:#e0dede;--awb-icon-color:#ffffff;--awb-title-color:#f47b4c;--awb-content-color:#4a4e57;--awb-icon-box-color:#333333;--awb-toggle-hover-accent-color:#a0ce4e;--awb-title-font-family:&quot;Red Hat Display&quot;;--awb-title-font-weight:400;--awb-title-font-style:normal;--awb-content-font-family:&quot;IBM Plex Sans&quot;;--awb-content-font-style:normal;--awb-content-font-weight:400;"><div class="panel-group fusion-toggle-icon-boxed" id="accordion-13-2"><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-d6c984f0bd940550e fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_d6c984f0bd940550e"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="d6c984f0bd940550e" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#d6c984f0bd940550e" href="#d6c984f0bd940550e"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">Is insurance required for my event?</span></a></h4></div><div id="d6c984f0bd940550e" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_d6c984f0bd940550e"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix">
<p style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">Yes–for all public events, we require General Liability Insurance with a minimum coverage of One Million Dollars ($1,000,000) per occurrence. SOMArts and the City and County of San Francisco must be added as additional insured, as SOMArts operates in a city-owned building. Additionally, for organizations renting the space, proof of Workers’ Compensation insurance is required if you have employees.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-055c35a99f965a538 fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_055c35a99f965a538"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="055c35a99f965a538" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#055c35a99f965a538" href="#055c35a99f965a538"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">What is your capacity?</span></a></h4></div><div id="055c35a99f965a538" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_055c35a99f965a538"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix">
<p style="font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium'; font-size: 20px;" data-fusion-font="true">Our Rental Space has a maximum capacity of 650 people. Please note that capacity decreases as tables, chairs, and other items are added to the space. The patio capacity is 300. When the building is rented in its entirety, it can accommodate up to 900 guests.</p>
</div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-82732054cdfa1e25c fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_82732054cdfa1e25c"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="82732054cdfa1e25c" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#82732054cdfa1e25c" href="#82732054cdfa1e25c"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">Where do we park vehicles for event staff, loading, and unloading?</span></a></h4></div><div id="82732054cdfa1e25c" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_82732054cdfa1e25c"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">SOMArts has a dedicated driveway off of Brannan St and a limited number of parking spaces near the door of our main entrance which, in most cases, can be used during load-in and load-out. If you are using the patio area for your event, then parking at the end of the driveway won’t be possible, but there is a paid </span><a style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" href="https://parkingconcepts.com/facilities/150-division-street-lot/" data-fusion-font="true">parking lot</a><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true"> directly across the street that typically has ample spaces for evening events, and there is usually street parking available (metered until 6pm) on Brannan St and 8th/9th St.</span></div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-3b716df89332851fb fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_3b716df89332851fb"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="3b716df89332851fb" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#3b716df89332851fb" href="#3b716df89332851fb"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">Can I drop off decorations/ food/ beverages in advance of my event?</span></a></h4></div><div id="3b716df89332851fb" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_3b716df89332851fb"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">We will do our best to accommodate pre-event drop-off needs. You can discuss this with the technical director leading up to your event.</span></div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-11ec98fd1ecb67d78 fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_11ec98fd1ecb67d78"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="11ec98fd1ecb67d78" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#11ec98fd1ecb67d78" href="#11ec98fd1ecb67d78"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">When are payments due?</span></a></h4></div><div id="11ec98fd1ecb67d78" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_11ec98fd1ecb67d78"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">50% of your total rental fee is due upon signing your contract in order to secure your date. The remaining balance is for at least 4 weeks prior to your event.</span></div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-9162aecfee00fde61 fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_9162aecfee00fde61"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="9162aecfee00fde61" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#9162aecfee00fde61" href="#9162aecfee00fde61"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">Do I need to rent audio equipment?</span></a></h4></div><div id="9162aecfee00fde61" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_9162aecfee00fde61"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">Every rental includes a full-size PA system with subwoofers, microphones, additional speakers, and accessories. Please note, we do not provide DJ gear, amps, or instruments.</span></div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-b042e37c8c3057d65 fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_b042e37c8c3057d65"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="b042e37c8c3057d65" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#b042e37c8c3057d65" href="#b042e37c8c3057d65"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">Do I need to rent lighting?</span></a></h4></div><div id="b042e37c8c3057d65" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_b042e37c8c3057d65"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix">
<p><span style="color: #4a4e57; font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">Your rental includes professional lighting for your event space. Lighting references can be <a href="https://www.flickr.com/photos/somarts/albums/72177720325147418/with/54456794220">found linked here. </a></span></p>
</div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-3b241d4bcdc60a9ee fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_3b241d4bcdc60a9ee"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="3b241d4bcdc60a9ee" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#3b241d4bcdc60a9ee" href="#3b241d4bcdc60a9ee"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">How big is the stage?</span></a></h4></div><div id="3b241d4bcdc60a9ee" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_3b241d4bcdc60a9ee"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix"><span style="color: #4a4e57; font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">The stage is 35′ wide, 17′ deep, and 3′ high.</span></div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-3c7a2bbf9b1f1602a fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_3c7a2bbf9b1f1602a"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="3c7a2bbf9b1f1602a" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#3c7a2bbf9b1f1602a" href="#3c7a2bbf9b1f1602a"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">Do you have tables and chairs?</span></a></h4></div><div id="3c7a2bbf9b1f1602a" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_3c7a2bbf9b1f1602a"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">Yes, we do have tables and chairs available! You can <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Amx0HGE5XNPxkz7ZTaXnDnZt9-wjlBTIg0Y2MQy3nWQ/edit?usp=sharing">view our inventory here. </a></span></div></div></div><div class="fusion-panel panel-default panel-b4ce9a7dd1f3621e2 fusion-toggle-has-divider"><div class="panel-heading"><h4 class="panel-title toggle" id="toggle_b4ce9a7dd1f3621e2"><a aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="b4ce9a7dd1f3621e2" role="button" data-toggle="collapse" data-parent="#accordion-13-2" data-target="#b4ce9a7dd1f3621e2" href="#b4ce9a7dd1f3621e2"><span class="fusion-toggle-icon-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-fusion-box active-icon awb-icon-minus" aria-hidden="true"></i><i class="fa-fusion-box inactive-icon awb-icon-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><span class="fusion-toggle-heading">Can we access your kitchen? </span></a></h4></div><div id="b4ce9a7dd1f3621e2" class="panel-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="toggle_b4ce9a7dd1f3621e2"><div class="panel-body toggle-content fusion-clearfix"><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true">We have a “kitchenette” which includes a sink, refrigerator, and freezer that clients can use during their rental. This space is great for light prep, but no cooking is permitted inside the building. Cooking can happen outside with the necessary </span><a style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" href="https://sf-fire.org/services/permits" data-fusion-font="true">fire permits</a><span style="font-size: 20px; font-family: 'Freight Micro Medium';" data-fusion-font="true"> secured before your event.</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-16 fusion-flex-container has-pattern-background has-mask-background nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling" style="--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-padding-top:0%;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;" ><div class="fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-content-wrap" style="max-width:1248px;margin-left: calc(-4% / 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% / 2 );"><div class="fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-36 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column" style="--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:100%;--awb-flex-grow:0;--awb-flex-shrink:0;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:1.92%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:1.92%;--awb-width-medium:100%;--awb-order-medium:0;--awb-flex-grow-medium:;--awb-flex-shrink-medium:;--awb-spacing-right-medium:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:1.92%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-order-small:0;--awb-flex-grow-small:;--awb-flex-shrink-small:;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;"><div class="fusion-column-wrapper fusion-column-has-shadow fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column"><div class="fusion-text fusion-text-26"><p>SOMArts reserves the right to decline any space request for any reason, including a determination that the event does not align with SOMArts&#8217; charitable purpose and mission.</p>
